sec.p:
The following cow milk butters were purchased from the local market:
Extra—83% fat content (Mlekpol, Grajewo, Poland);
“Whetstone” extra—82% fat content (Pilos, Lukow, Poland);
Reduced—fat content 60% (Pilos Warlub, Poland);
Clarified (Mlekovita, Wysokie Mazowieckie, Poland);
Lactose-free (Pilos, Lowicz, Poland);
Salted (Kerrygold, Ireland).
